tuK4rl","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","statusNotes":"Imposes severe point deductions and detention because she believes the students invented the dragon story.","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":14.000001,"createdAt":1784505600000,"updatedAt":1784578680582},{"id":"snap-ev-caught-after-norbert-char-neville","worldId":"hp-ps-world","characterId":"char-neville","eventId":"ev-caught-after-norbert","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"loc-astronomy-tower","currentMapLayerId":"zQnRT-UK0Tzw0qjtuK4rl","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","statusNotes":"Is punished for leaving the tower while trying to help his friends.","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":14.000001,"createdAt":1784505600000,"updatedAt":1784578680582},{"id":"snap-ev-christmas-gifts-char-harry","worldId":"hp-ps-world","characterId":"char-harry","eventId":"ev-christmas-gifts","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"loc-gryffindor-tower","currentMapLayerId":"zQnRT-UK0Tzw0qjtuK4rl","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","statusNotes":"Experiences his first joyful Christmas and receives an Invisibility Cloak tied to his father.","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":11.9999995,"createdAt":1784505600000,"updatedAt":1784578680582},{"id":"snap-ev-christmas-gifts-char-ron","worldId":"hp-ps-world","characterId":"char-ron","eventId":"ev-christmas-gifts","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"loc-gryffindor-tower","currentMapLayerId":"zQnRT-UK0Tzw0qjtuK4rl","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","statusNotes":"Shares his family’s traditions and gifts with Harry during the nearly empty holiday castle.","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":11.9999995,"createdAt":1784505600000,"updatedAt":1784578680582},{"id":"snap-ev-crossing-black-lake-char-draco","worldId":"hp-ps-world","characterId":"char-draco","eventId":"ev-crossing-black-lake","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"loc-black-lake","currentMapLayerId":"hp-map-hogwarts-grounds","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","statusNotes":"Crosses toward the castle with confidence and an expectation of belonging.","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":6.999999,"createdAt":1784505600000,"updatedAt":1784578680582},{"id":"snap-ev-crossing-black-lake-char-hagrid","worldId":"hp-ps-world","characterId":"char-hagrid","eventId":"ev-crossing-black-lake","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"loc-black-lake","currentMapLayerId":"hp-map-hogwarts-grounds","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","statusNotes":"Leads the first-years across the lake and proudly reveals Hogwarts.","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":6.999999,"createdAt":1784505600000,"updatedAt":1784578680582},{"id":"snap-ev-crossing-black-lake-char-harry","worldId":"hp-ps-world","characterId":"char-harry","eventId":"ev-crossing-black-lake","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"loc-black-lake","currentMapLayerId":"hp-map-hogwarts-grounds","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","statusNotes":"Awestruck by his first sight of the illuminated castle that will become his home.","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":6.999999,"createdAt":1784505600000,"updatedAt":1784578680582},{"id":"snap-ev-crossing-black-lake-char-hermione","worldId":"hp-ps-world","characterId":"char-hermione","eventId":"ev-crossing-black-lake","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"loc-black-lake","currentMapLayerId":"hp-map-hogwarts-grounds","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","statusNotes":"Eager and attentive as the first-years approach the school.","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":6.999999,"createdAt":1784505600000,"updatedAt":1784578680582},{"id":"snap-ev-crossing-black-lake-char-neville","worldId":"hp-ps-world","characterId":"char-neville","eventId":"ev-crossing-black-lake","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"loc-black-lake","currentMapLayerId":"hp-map-hogwarts-grounds","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","statusNotes":"Nervous about the arrival and still worried about keeping track of Trevor.","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":6.999999,"createdAt":1784505600000,"updatedAt":1784578680582},{"id":"sna