n.","createdAt":1784505600000,"updatedAt":1784505600000},{"id":"thread-quidditch","worldId":"hp-ps-world","name":"Harry's First Quidditch Season","color":"#059669","description":"Harry discovers his talent for flying, becomes Gryffindor's youngest Seeker in a century, and proves himself in competition.","createdAt":1784505600000,"updatedAt":1784505600000},{"id":"thread-snape","worldId":"hp-ps-world","name":"Suspicion of Snape","color":"#2563eb","description":"Snape's hostility and secret actions make him appear to be the thief until the final confrontation reveals that he was protecting Harry.","createdAt":1784505600000,"updatedAt":1784505600000},{"id":"thread-stone","worldId":"hp-ps-world","name":"The Philosopher's Stone Mystery","color":"#d4af37","description":"Harry, Ron, and Hermione uncover what Fluffy guards, identify Nicolas Flamel, and race to prevent the Stone from being stolen.","createdAt":1784505600000,"updatedAt":1784505600000},{"id":"thread-voldemort","worldId":"hp-ps-world","name":"Voldemort's Return","color":"#111827","description":"The shadow of Voldemort's first defeat develops into his attempt to regain a body and power through the Philosopher's Stone.","createdAt":1784505600000,"updatedAt":1784505600000}],"motifs":[],"continuitySuppressions":[],"writingLogs":[],"sceneRevisions":[],"tombstones":[],"relationshipPositions":{"char-harry":{"x":-179.67283047107276,"y":292.67106984774966},"char-ron":{"x":200,"y":0},"char-hermione":{"x":100,"y":160},"char-hagrid":{"x":-819.4849275583069,"y":47.14728673386378},"char-dumbledore":{"x":-445.2305217776623,"y":-179.93351581815818},"char-snape":{"x":-919.6620165404074,"y":302.92058633248894},"char-quirrell":{"x":240,"y":-180},"char-voldemort":{"x":400,"y":-160},"char-draco":{"x":320,"y":160},"char-neville":{"x":520.5416026586505,"y":767.8763140869637},"char-mcgonagall":{"x":-794.4406553127817,"y":-315.98139571777216},"char-norbert":{"x":-678.3603793916104,"y":437.2254955125653},"char-lee":{"x":819.002737272373,